// endpoint_select_account.proto — SelectAccount: make this workspace's
// session spend as a given account root. TOPBAR section, the account cell's
// dropdown pick (TopbarAccount.options).
//
// THE ROOT IS THE ECHO TOKEN. The client sends back an option's own
// `config_dir` unchanged; it never composes a path and never names a root the
// daemon did not serve. A root outside the set the daemon knows is
// `unknown_account`, not a root it will create.
//
// THE SWITCH IS A RESTART. The daemon records the chosen root on the
// workspace's session and brings the session back up under it, exactly as the
// restart verb does — so the cold gate applies here as it applies to any
// resume, and every visible effect arrives on the streams rather than in this
// response.
//
// A LOGGED-OUT ROOT IS STILL A SUCCESS. The choice is honored: the workspace
// is switched, and the client opens that root's login flow (OpenLogin) the way
// the logged-out account cell's own click does. Answering an error would leave
// the reader with no way to log a known root in.

